{"ID":"20240314092144-un6qf9a","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092144-un6qf9a","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092144-un6qf9a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161620-uebsna9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161620-um4zxp1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161620-qur21h9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:5\u0026#125;","title":"【茯苓杏仁甘草汤】\u0026amp;【桔枳生姜汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422161631"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422161620-uebsna9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422161620-uebsna9","updated":"20240422161620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胸痹，胸中气塞，短气，茯苓杏仁甘草汤主之，桔枳生姜汤亦主之"}]},{"ID":"20240422161620-gh2mrot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161620-gh2mrot","updated":"20240422161620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓杏仁甘草汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161620-h87blri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161620-h87blri","updated":"20240422161620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓三两杏仁五十个甘草一两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161620-of1v28y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161620-of1v28y","updated":"20240422161620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水一斗，煮取五升，温服一升，日三服，不差，更服"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161620-4ny36l4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161620-4ny36l4","updated":"20240422161620"}},{"ID":"20240422161620-qur21h9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161620-qur21h9","updated":"20240422161620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桔枳生姜汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161620-zl96dx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161620-zl96dx6","updated":"20240422161620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桔皮一斤枳实三两生姜半斤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161620-pnejqbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161620-pnejqbi","updated":"20240422161620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接下来呢，这个胸痹，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胸中气塞，短气，茯苓杏仁甘草汤主之"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。像这种气闷呢，用到茯苓杏仁甘草汤，都是缓痛，不会很强烈的痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161620-po0gnzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161620-po0gnzt","updated":"20240422161620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里呢，提到杏仁，上一节我们在谈论到肺里面有脓疡的时候，化脓的时候，痰出来是黄浊的痰的时候，有人提到麻杏甘石汤跟苇茎汤，差异在哪里，麻杏，我们用到杏仁呢，基本上杏仁都是润肺的，因为肺又主皮毛，杏仁又是色白，辛香的，杏仁很香嘛，这个入肺，所以杏仁可以保养皮肤啊，它入肺，是润肺的，所以一定是用在肺的燥，比较燥时用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻杏甘石汤配在一起的时候，是一般的只是咳嗽，痰很容易出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一咳就出来，黄痰很容易出来，等你用到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"苇茎汤的时候，病人已咳嗽、喘气得很厉害"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"了，呼呼的很大声，痰不容易出来，但是有痰在里面，舌胎一看又是黄湿，知道有痰在里面，病人呼吸你可以听到气管里面很多的痰声，但是痰又咳不出来，这个时候，就是千金苇茎汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"苇茎呢，会为什么会用到苇茎，苇茎呢一根一根，直直的，像肺的气管一样，生在水里面，所以它能够通肺的气非常的强"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这是这两个稍微不太一样的地方。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161620-um4zxp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161620-um4zxp1","updated":"20240422161620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个临床上，我们在这个缓痛，胸中气塞，闷闷的短气的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓杏仁甘草汤是用在心脏有积水的时候"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，处方非常的简单，茯苓呢它可以利水，我说心脏积水，并不是真正的水停在心脏里面，而是这个水在心包的周围，停水在这边。那我们靠茯苓把水利掉，加一点点杏仁下去，为什么？因为杏仁可以润肺，我们在利水的同时，同时去润肺，就不会把肺里面的津液伤到，这个茯苓甘草，实际上主力是茯苓甘草，这个茯苓甘草两个配在一起的时候，诸位看，这个茯苓甘草两个配在一起的时候，是三比一，如果茯苓是六钱，甘草是两钱，那甘草跟茯苓能够把心脏里面的水排掉。"}]}]}